    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_622_01:622_01_004:47cf9f5f",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C06_622_01",
        "key": "622_01_004",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_622_01:622_01_004:47cf9f5f",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_622_01:622_01_004:47cf9f5f",
        "jp_sha256": "33865b42dc5f36b0cbd5a5292fc87d0cfea726b106ab2edf584c12d3f432cb8b",
        "official_en_sha256": "e0f5433e601aa610ccae80ed2c453b4adf91269ea79f0535c909237499b343ff"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "しかし、騎士団でレインと一緒にいるためには、\r\n同じぐらい強くなければならない。\r\nだから、俺はずっと鍛錬を続けてきた。",
        "official_en": "To stand beside Rain in the knight order, I had to match his strength. So I trained day in and day out, driven by the need to keep up with him.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_C06_622_01",
        "sequence": null,
        "speaker": {
          "applicability": "REQUIRED",
          "label_jp": "ラスウェル",
          "label_status": "VERIFIED",
          "name_entry": "CharaName0003",
          "identity": null,
          "runtime_character_id": null,
          "evidence_refs": [
            "key-identities:ST_C06_622_01/622_01_004"
          ]
        },
        "addressee": null,
        "branch_ref": null,
        "voice_ref": null
      }
    },
    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_622_01:622_01_003:b8b8831b",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C06_622_01",
        "key": "622_01_003",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_622_01:622_01_003:b8b8831b",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_622_01:622_01_003:b8b8831b",
        "jp_sha256": "38117a58b42e7290f2ed4fed1ff8ddce6dfb3d91d8970a9e4a34d3464a5858ba",
        "official_en_sha256": "5189629a60ff60e32dc8d5f56c6d5e15ef3c58889ae2d8fb76962b5fb64c26f9"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そのとき思ったんだ。\r\nレインには一生かなわないと。",
        "official_en": "I thought to myself, he’s always going to be better than me.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_C06_622_01",
