        "speaker": {
          "applicability": "REQUIRED",
          "label_jp": "ラスウェル",
          "label_status": "VERIFIED",
          "name_entry": "CharaName0003",
          "identity": null,
          "runtime_character_id": null,
          "evidence_refs": [
            "key-identities:ST_C06_622_01/622_01_003"
          ]
        },
        "addressee": null,
        "branch_ref": null,
        "voice_ref": null
      }
    },
    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_622_01:622_01_005:fe57a1e4",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C06_622_01",
        "key": "622_01_005",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_622_01:622_01_005:fe57a1e4",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_622_01:622_01_005:fe57a1e4",
        "jp_sha256": "ffe334e44da9428b6105958ea0686725386252efceb07750725049ab4ccbac07",
        "official_en_sha256": "2a3f8f11916a70b4dfe3b1f765dc004540ff1f0ada10a61dfa905a7937e177ee"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "それで隊長と副隊長になれたんだね。",
        "official_en": "And then Rain became the squadron commander, and through your own efforts you became his deputy commander.",
        "real_en": "And that's how you became captain and vice-captain."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_C06_622_01",
        "sequence": null,
        "speaker": {
          "applicability": "REQUIRED",
          "label_jp": "フィーナ",
          "label_status": "VERIFIED",
          "name_entry": "CharaName0004",
          "identity": null,
          "runtime_character_id": null,
          "evidence_refs": [
            "key-identities:ST_C06_622_01/622_01_005"
          ]
        },
        "addressee": null,
        "branch_ref": null,
        "voice_ref": null
      }
    },
    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_622_01:622_01_019:e2b81dbf",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C06_622_01",
        "key": "622_01_019",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_622_01:622_01_019:e2b81dbf",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_622_01:622_01_019:e2b81dbf",
        "jp_sha256": "9ce92b03bb5b8cfcdc964ffdc9afb8f96e63d661ef5e4739907ce835a2f18988",
        "official_en_sha256": "6d04635f709b823ef5501e2ac9303644934b3e70eaaac9870d6cb874b6c66c00"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だったらその思いを貫き通せよ。\r\nお前もグランシェルトの騎士だろ。",
        "official_en": "Then you’d better keep your word. You’re a knight of Grandshelt.",
        "real_en": "Then hold on to that resolve. You're a knight of Grandshelt too, aren't you?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_C06_622_01",
        "sequence": null,
        "speaker": {
          "applicability": "REQUIRED",
          "label_jp": "レイン",
          "label_status": "VERIFIED",
          "name_entry": "CharaName0002",
          "identity": null,
          "runtime_character_id": null,
          "evidence_refs": [
            "key-identities:ST_C06_622_01/622_01_019"
          ]
        },
        "addressee": null,
        "branch_ref": null,
        "voice_ref": null
      }
    },
    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_622_01:622_01_025:69d769db",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C06_622_01",
        "key": "622_01_025",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_622_01:622_01_025:69d769db",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_622_01:622_01_025:69d769db",
        "jp_sha256": "a57d709910bae09abfab1a3c32e9bd1e98d0ad695997c4d446e8658f76c2a3af",
        "official_en_sha256": "d204e04ae02ccb63bee07b1c1853617fa30882445ff09cc37dcaca40b592f7d3"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だってあそこまで強くなったのは\r\nラスウェルの努力の結果だろ。\r\nそれが出し切れないんじゃかわいそうだ。",
        "official_en": "After all, Lasswell worked really hard to get this strong. It wouldn’t be fair if he didn’t get to give everything he’s got.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_C06_622_01",
        "sequence": null,
        "speaker": {
          "applicability": "REQUIRED",
          "label_jp": "レイン",
          "label_status": "VERIFIED",
          "name_entry": "CharaName0002",
          "identity": null,
          "runtime_character_id": null,
          "evidence_refs": [
            "key-identities:ST_C06_622_01/622_01_025"
          ]
        },
        "addressee": null,
        "branch_ref": null,
        "voice_ref": null
      }
    },
    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_622_01:622_01_024:dc44a26a",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C06_622_01",
        "key": "622_01_024",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_622_01:622_01_024:dc44a26a",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_622_01:622_01_024:dc44a26a",
        "jp_sha256": "7658d11dc0383c511b0a9f5be83eb027a44b17c6f7c1e0e9081ca07f01b72580",
        "official_en_sha256": "aea2276b3e1a2dbca644e2a6a7c70a038b3e69248a8c92bcb1370d1a338452e1"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "でも、だからこそ全力でいく。\r\n自分の力を限界まで振り絞って\r\n地べたを這っても最後まで戦う。",
        "official_en": "But that’s exactly why I won’t hold back. I’ll give this fight everything I’ve got. I’ll crawl through the mud if I need to.",
        "real_en": "But that's exactly why I'll give it everything I've got. I'll draw on every last bit of strength and fight to the end, even if I have to crawl."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_C06_622_01",
        "sequence": null,
        "speaker": {
