        "official_en_sha256": "e95ce6cdfed22dbd10b00781d5e2424f5cecf8840104243ba5f3e17f9447cc93"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "俺はあいつの太陽みたいなところが大好きだった。",
        "official_en": "The thing about Rain I adore the most is his bright, sunny disposition.",
