      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "子供の頃……。\r\n俺がやっとの思いで身に付けた明鏡を\r\nレインは軽々と放った。",
        "official_en": "When we were kids, I worked so hard to master Tranquility, but Rain pulled it off so effortlessly.",
        "real_en": null
