        "namespace": "ST_C06_622_01",
        "key": "622_01_023",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_622_01:622_01_023:376e21ed",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C06_622_01:622_01_023:376e21ed",
        "jp_sha256": "2b63c05db3b6d10bba8471add5a9bda3e4e82c1266e4b72e7f40465cfa7037b7",
        "official_en_sha256": "6b94fa84f08a6125e26fd14d46c8a0f9e860e15eba7cde2b5eb403386b9a2e0c"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "実際、そう思うよ。\r\n最近のあいつの成長ぶりを見ていたら。",
        "official_en": "And after seeing how strong he’s become recently, I agree with him. I think there’s a good chance I’ll lose.",
        "real_en": "I really do think so, after seeing how much he's grown lately."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
